{"3966800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VINCIT", "steam_appid": 3966800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5026270], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VINCIT</i></strong> is a fast-paced FPS that fuses the relentless combat of <i>Ultrakill</i> with the spellcasting depth of <i>Magicka</i> – wrapped in a striking manga art style. The world shattered when humanity pushed the <i>Aether</i> too far – a force that bends time and tears reality apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/15295e0a43117ffa9b0486e00ddfee38.poster.avif?t=1786957403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/15295e0a43117ffa9b0486e00ddfee38.webm?t=1786957403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/15295e0a43117ffa9b0486e00ddfee38.mp4?t=1786957403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our hero and his crew set out to piece the world back together, only to walk straight into a trap laid by the vassals of the <strong>Yellow King</strong> – heralds of chaos hell-bent on finishing what the <i>Aether</i> started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/e76826b73f3f5cd05e73e129dbcf08d7.poster.avif?t=1786957403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/e76826b73f3f5cd05e73e129dbcf08d7.webm?t=1786957403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/e76826b73f3f5cd05e73e129dbcf08d7.mp4?t=1786957403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your bullets. Load them with elemental effects – fire, water, electricity, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/88c12cc6938bfdd5dda1bd83a857e098.poster.avif?t=1786957403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/88c12cc6938bfdd5dda1bd83a857e098.webm?t=1786957403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/88c12cc6938bfdd5dda1bd83a857e098.mp4?t=1786957403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch the bullets mid-air and mix them to activate different effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bullet is a physical object. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every combination hits differently. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effects interact with enemies and the environment in ways that reward experimentation – and punish hesitation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <i><strong>Vincit</strong></i> solo or <strong>with friends</strong>, build the ultimate loadout, and tear through your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VINCIT</i></strong> is a fast-paced FPS that fuses the relentless combat of <i>Ultrakill</i> with the spellcasting depth of <i>Magicka</i> – wrapped in a striking manga art style. The world shattered when humanity pushed the <i>Aether</i> too far – a force that bends time and tears reality apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra